<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοφ-ῐά</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοφ-ῐή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mane</i> or <i>bristly ridge</i> on the back of
			animals, <i>mane</i> of horses, <i>bristly back</i> of boars and
			hyenas (cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				658a30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				498b30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				579b16
			</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρίξας εὖ λοφιήν</span>, of a
			wild boar, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.446
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθὰς ἐν λοφιῇ φρίσσει τρίχας ἀμφί
					τε δειρήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					391
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντὶ λόφου ἡ λοφιὴ κατέχρα</span>
			<i>the mane</i> served for a plume, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.70
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>backfin</i> of dolphins and similar fishes, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.222
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				1.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόφος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i>ridge</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jo.</u>
				15.2
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.249
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maec.
			</span></i>).</div>
